            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Missy Hoglen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a version of this when I was younger. Substituted butter for bacon grease and added grated cheddar cheese and canned chopped tomatoes. My grandmother won a blue ribbon for this recipe at the senior cook off.",
            "datePublished": "2014-11-09T15:04:32.123Z"
