              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cabgirl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband has been making this for years. He uses red onion, a chopped jalapeno, and a dash of a secret ingredient (famous in Lincoln, NE) Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-10T15:56:20.380Z"
