            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nani"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I doubled the recipe to use as a side dish for 9 people - definitely enough!\n\nI found the end result to be a bit greasy, next time I'll dump 1/2 the bacon grease and leave just enough to coat the pan.\n\nI would also like to add more flavor to this dish. Some of the versions I read called for Seasoning Salt. I added Lawry's Seasoned Salt in addition to salt and pepper, but next time I'll go a little heavier. \n\nOverall - not my all time favorite, but a good dish to accompany corned beef and cabbage (see slow cooker recipe for an easy meal!)",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-21T10:17:03.450Z"
          },
          {
